# Every test script, with tags saying what it needs. scripts/run-tests.py runs
# them and refuses to run while this list and the scripts/test-* and
# imessage/tests/test-* files disagree, so a new test goes in here too.
#
# A test exits 0 to pass, 77 to skip (printing a line that starts with SKIP)
# and anything else to fail. Run one by hand with its interpreter:
# python3 for .py, bash when its first line names bash, sh otherwise.

@tag docker  needs a running Docker daemon (compose config, docker run or build); skipped without one
@tag image   has checks inside the pinned Hermes image, through scripts/lib/hermes_image.py or hermes-image.sh; without the image only its host part runs
@tag macos   needs macOS with swiftc; skipped elsewhere
@tag ci      runs in .github/workflows/ci.yml (host part only for image tests)

imessage/tests/test-messages-app.py             macos
imessage/tests/test-messages-index.py
imessage/tests/test-messages-mcp-container.py   docker
imessage/tests/test-messages-mcp.py
imessage/tests/test-messages-watch.py
imessage/tests/test-synthetic-messages.py
